            "speakerName": "观海",
            "text": "「万民堂」的招牌菜啊，早吃过很多次了，而且也不是酸甜口的，感觉不大想吃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133209",
      "subQuestName": "(test)玩家选错水晶虾$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413320631"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413320631": {
            "id": "413320631",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我推荐<color=#00E1FFFF>水晶虾</color>。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413320632"
            ]
          },
          "413320632": {
            "id": "413320632",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "观海",
            "text": "这道菜里面没有鱼吧，而且味道也很寡淡，感觉不大想吃。"
          }
