    {
      "subId": "4133213",
      "subQuestName": "询问大家的口味（1/3）",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413320751"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413320751": {
            "id": "413320751",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我推荐<color=#00E1FFFF>莲花酥</color>。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413320752"
            ]
          },
          "413320752": {
            "id": "413320752",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "志华",
            "text": "哦？感觉不错，小巧精致，味道也很不错，很适合…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413320753"
            ]
          },
          "413320753": {
            "id": "413320753",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "志华",
            "text": "咳…总之就是这道菜了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133205",
      "subQuestName": "(test)玩家选错扣三丝$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413320521"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413320521": {
            "id": "413320521",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我推荐<color=#00E1FFFF>扣三丝</color>。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413320522"
            ]
          },
          "413320522": {
            "id": "413320522",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "李锤子",
            "text": "我听说书的讲过，扣三丝那菜只要嘬一口，汤就没了，我觉得不行。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413320523"
            ]
          },
          "413320523": {
            "id": "413320523",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "王扳子",
            "text": "你什么时候去听的说书？怎么没叫我？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133206",
      "subQuestName": "(test)玩家选错来来菜$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413320531"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413320531": {
            "id": "413320531",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我推荐<color=#00E1FFFF>来来菜</color>。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413320532"
            ]
          },
          "413320532": {
            "id": "413320532",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "李锤子",
            "text": "我听说书的讲过，来来菜讲究不小，不过这菜里面没笋，我觉得不行。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413320533"
            ]
          },
          "413320533": {
            "id": "413320533",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "王扳子",
            "text": "说书的什么时候还讲上菜谱了？我完全没印象…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133207",
      "subQuestName": "询问大家的口味（2/3）",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413320551"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413320551": {
            "id": "413320551",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我推荐<color=#00E1FFFF>腌笃鲜</color>。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413320552"
            ]
          },
          "413320552": {
            "id": "413320552",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "李锤子",
            "text": "这菜好，我听说书的讲——「文火细炖，滋味悠长」，肯定好吃。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413320553"
            ]
          },
          "413320553": {
            "id": "413320553",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "王扳子",
            "text": "不错不错，那就它了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133214",
      "subQuestName": "向卯师傅回报",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413321401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413321401": {
            "id": "413321401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "餐送到了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321402"
            ]
          },
          "413321402": {
            "id": "413321402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "送到了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321403"
            ]
          },
          "413321403": {
            "id": "413321403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "好，请你帮忙果然没错，王扳子、观海还有志华想吃的菜也都问到了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321404"
            ]
          },
          "413321404": {
            "id": "413321404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "王扳子和李锤子想吃腌笃鲜。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321405"
            ]
          },
          "413321405": {
            "id": "413321405",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "哦？这哥俩口味倒一致，不过腌笃鲜可是费工夫的菜，我得早些准备。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321407"
            ]
          },
          "413321407": {
            "id": "413321407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "观海想吃松鼠鱼。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321408"
            ]
          },
          "413321408": {
            "id": "413321408",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "没问题，这菜我拿手。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321409"
            ]
          },
          "413321409": {
            "id": "413321409",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "志华想吃莲花酥。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321410"
            ]
          },
          "413321410": {
            "id": "413321410",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "没想到志华喜欢吃这种小巧精致的点心，不过莲花酥也不难做，没问题。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321411"
            ]
          },
          "413321411": {
            "id": "413321411",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "谢谢你帮我去打听了，这点薄礼你可得收下，我得赶快去忙活了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321412"
            ]
          },
          "413321412": {
            "id": "413321412",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你不挂霄灯吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321413"
            ]
          },
          "413321413": {
            "id": "413321413",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "嗨，哪有那时间，我忙着炒菜，香菱刚过来拿了新的餐送出去了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321414"
            ]
          },
          "413321414": {
            "id": "413321414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "我们这父女俩忙得脚不沾地，哪有那时间。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413321417"
            ]
          },
          "413321417": {
            "id": "413321417",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "你…你愿意帮忙？那就拜托你了，那我正发愁，店里没霄灯，没有过节的感觉呢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
